{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d8a694f3-7c56-846d-b3af-48b57e53bc11",
  "created_at": "2025-12-19T11:50:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lucille Cardillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:47:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:47:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Tony, and thank you for answering. I hope you are well today. My name is Lucille Cardillo. I am sorry, I am on the speaker, my hands are not clean right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:47:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, Mrs. Cardillo. I can hear you fine. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:47:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I restore old bicycles, in the garage, and I have grease up to here. So the phone is on the speaker. Anyway. I have my water and sewer bill here, and the number is higher than I expected. Much higher."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:48:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me pull it up. Can I get the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:48:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 345 Carroll Avenue. The Fifth Ward. But the account, it is not in my name. It is in my husband's name. He passed, and I never changed it. Is that a problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:48:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not a problem for looking at it. I'm sorry for your loss. I've got the account here under that name. I see the bill you mean. What's the part that bothers you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:48:39-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not want you to change anything, please. I only want it explained. There is a line, the usage, and then another line for sewer, and the sewer is almost the same as the water. Why is it so? We do not use so much. It is only me in the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:48:56-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. So the water line is what the meter read, how much water came through. The sewer charge is based on that same number. Whatever water comes in is treated as going back out to the sewer, so the two track each other pretty closely."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:49:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Even the water for the garden? In the summer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:49:15-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, ma'am, it's billed off the meter reading, so it counts. Though in December that wouldn't be the issue. Let me look at the readings. [pause] Okay, this one looks like it covers a few months, not just one, so that's part of why it looks big."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:49:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah. A few months. I did not see that. So it is not a mistake."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:49:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Doesn't look like one from here. The reading's in line with the past couple of bills when you break it out by month."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:49:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Then one more question, please. Is there any discount, for people who are older, or with low income? I am in my sixties, and it is only my one income now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:49:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have a discount program to point you to on this end for the water and sewer. I can have someone in the office look into whether anything exists and call you back. Is this the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:50:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is 401-555-0156. Thank you, Tony. You are very kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:50:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0156. And if you want the account moved into your name, you can ask about that at the office too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:50:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will do that. Thank you. God bless you, and have a good weekend. I must go wash my hands now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T11:50:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mrs. Cardillo. Take care."
    }
  ],
